eading ult-adjust-bottom-margin ultimate-heading-55166a0da940bc68e uvc-929 \" data-hspacer=\"line_only\"  data-halign=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left\"><div class=\"uvc-main-heading ult-responsive\"  data-ultimate-target='.uvc-heading.ultimate-heading-55166a0da940bc68e h2'  data-responsive-json-new='{\"font-size\":\"\",\"line-height\":\"\"}' ><h2 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Co je Teaspoon Club?<\/h2><\/div><div class=\"uvc-heading-spacer line_only\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5em;height:1px;\"><span class=\"uvc-headings-line\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#af1b1d;width:autopx;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div>[vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Angli\u010dtina pro seniory\u2026<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>\u0158\u00edk\u00e1te si: \u201eTo u\u017e nen\u00ed pro m\u011b.\u201c \u201eTo nem\u00e1 smysl.\u201c<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>P\u0159itom tajn\u011b tou\u017e\u00edte se op\u011bt n\u011b\u010demu nov\u00e9mu u\u010dit?<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Zvl\u00e1dnete to i vy!\u00a0<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Jmenuji se Al\u017eb\u011bta Rychteck\u00e1 a\u00a0se sv\u00fdmi kolegyn\u011bmi u\u010d\u00edm seniory angli\u010dtinu.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Na\u0161e kurzy prob\u00edhaj\u00ed v\u00a0mal\u00fdch skupink\u00e1ch, a\u00a0tak v\u00e1m m\u016f\u017eeme sl\u00edbit velmi osobn\u00ed p\u0159\u00edstup i\u00a0tempo.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">\u017d\u00e1dn\u00e9 lavice, jen p\u0159\u00edjemn\u011b neform\u00e1ln\u00ed prost\u0159ed\u00ed, kde se nemus\u00edte b\u00e1t na cokoli zeptat. N\u00e1\u0161 koncept se kapku inspiroval tradic\u00ed anglick\u00fdch \u010dajov\u00fdch klub\u016f. P\u0159ij\u010fte k\u00a0n\u00e1m na \u0161\u00e1lek \u010daje, u\u00a0kter\u00e9ho si budete moci pokl\u00e1bosit s\u00a0vrstevn\u00edky, a\u00a0je\u0161t\u011b se nau\u010d\u00edte nov\u00e9mu jazyku.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Tahle aktivita v\u00e1s chytne za \u00fasm\u011bv a\u00a0nepust\u00ed.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Zkuste to, je \u010das \ud83d\ude42<\/p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Al\u017eb\u011btin styl v\u00fduky a\u00a0p\u0159\u00edstup byl velmi dobr\u00fd, a\u00a0i\u00a0kdy\u017e jsme ob\u010das byli tu\u017e\u0161\u00edm materi\u00e1lem, shodli jsme se na tom, \u017ee n\u00e1m v\u00a0tom roce dala z\u00a0v\u00fduky nejv\u00edce ze v\u0161ech minul\u00fdch i\u00a0pozd\u011bj\u0161\u00edch u\u010ditel\u016f.<\/p>\n<footer>Ji\u0159\u00ed Arno\u0161t<\/footer>\n<\/blockquote>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8220;1\/2&#8243; css=&#8220;.vc_custom_1630628940330{background-image: url(http:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/cojeto.jpg?id=14) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;border-radius: 5px !important;}&#8220;]<div class=\"ult-spacer spacer-6a0da940bc6be\" data-id=\"6a0da940bc6be\" data-height=\"520\" data-height-mobile=\"520\" data-height-tab=\"520\" data-height-tab-portrait=\"\" data-height-mobile-landscape=\"\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row padding_bottom_multiplier=&#8220;3x&#8220; gap=&#8220;20&#8243; equal_height=&#8220;yes&#8220; css=&#8220;.vc_custom_1630631089914{margin-top: 40px !important;margin-bottom: 40px !important;}&#8220;][vc_column width=&#8220;1\/2&#8243; css=&#8220;.vc_custom_1630631738595{background-image: url(http:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/slide_2.jpg?id=21) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;border-radius: 5px !important;}&#8220;]<div class=\"ult-spacer spacer-6a0da940bc6d0\" data-id=\"6a0da940bc6d0\" data-height=\"520\" data-height-mobile=\"520\" data-height-tab=\"520\" data-height-tab-portrait=\"\" data-height-mobile-landscape=\"\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8220;1\/2&#8243; css=&#8220;.vc_custom_1631923825709{padding-right: 1em !important;padding-left: 1em !important;}&#8220;]<div id=\"ultimate-heading-39306a0da940bc704\" class=\"uvc-heading ult-adjust-bottom-margin ultimate-heading-39306a0da940bc704 uvc-4839 \" data-hspacer=\"line_only\"  data-halign=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left\"><div class=\"uvc-main-heading ult-responsive\"  data-ultimate-target='.uvc-heading.ultimate-heading-39306a0da940bc704 h2'  data-responsive-json-new='{\"font-size\":\"\",\"line-height\":\"\"}' ><h2 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Pro\u010d za\u010d\u00edt?<\/h2><\/div><div class=\"uvc-heading-spacer line_only\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5em;height:1px;\"><span class=\"uvc-headings-line\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#af1b1d;width:autopx;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div>[vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Cvi\u010dte mysl<\/strong>. Nenechte hlavu na holi\u010dk\u00e1ch a\u00a0nab\u00eddn\u011bte j\u00ed pomocnou aktivitu. V\u00e1\u0161 mozek si bude mlaskat. \u00a0U\u010den\u00ed ciz\u00edmu jazyku udr\u017euje my\u0161len\u00ed sv\u011b\u017e\u00ed, \u00fasudek ostr\u00fd a\u00a0pam\u011b\u0165 spolehlivou.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Tak, jako v\u00a0anglick\u00fdch \u010dajov\u00fdch klubech, i\u00a0u\u00a0n\u00e1s d\u00edky <strong>hrav\u00e9mu stylu v\u00fduky, mal\u00fdm skupink\u00e1m do 10\u00a0lid\u00ed a\u00a0\u0161\u00e1lku \u010daje, k\u00e1vy\u00a0<\/strong>a n\u011b\u010demu mal\u00e9mu na zub panuje <strong>p\u0159\u00edjemn\u00e1 neform\u00e1ln\u00ed atmosf\u00e9ra<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Pravidelnost<\/strong>. Ka\u017ed\u00fd t\u00fdden n\u011bco, na co se m\u016f\u017eete t\u011b\u0161it.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>P\u0159ij\u010fte na i\u00a0na v\u00e1no\u010dn\u00ed bes\u00eddku nebo setk\u00e1n\u00ed kurzu ke konci roku<\/strong>. Jednou za \u010das po\u0159\u00e1d\u00e1me klubov\u00e1 setk\u00e1n\u00ed s v\u00e1no\u010dn\u00edm programem, v angli\u010dtin\u011b i \u010de\u0161tin\u011b a celkov\u011b si po\u010d\u00edn\u00e1me jako dobr\u00e1 parta, kde se ka\u017ed\u00fd c\u00edt\u00ed v\u00edt\u00e1n \ud83d\ude42<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Pokud budete s\u00a0\u00fakoly, texty nebo t\u0159eba jen se \u00a0slov\u00ed\u010dkem v\u00a0konc\u00edch, jsem v\u00e1m k\u00a0dispozici, <strong>zavolejte a\u00a0j\u00e1 v\u00e1m porad\u00edm<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p>A na z\u00e1v\u011br to nejlep\u0161\u00ed. Z\u00edsk\u00e1te mil\u00e9 zn\u00e1m\u00e9, <strong>angli\u010dtina<\/strong> s\u00a0nimi bude pot\u011b\u0161en\u00edm a\u00a0dokonce i\u00a0<strong>kon\u00ed\u010dkem!<\/strong><\/p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Krom\u011b neot\u0159el\u00e9ho zp\u016fsobu Al\u017eb\u011btiny v\u00fduky a\u00a0naprost\u00e9 profesionality, oce\u0148uji neform\u00e1ln\u00ed lidsk\u00fd p\u0159\u00edstup a\u00a0p\u0159edev\u0161\u00edm nezapomenutelnou osobnost, kter\u00e1 V\u00e1s nikdy nep\u0159estane bavit.<\/p>\n<footer>Nora Rotterov\u00e1<\/footer>\n<\/blockquote>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row padding_bottom_multiplier=&#8220;3x&#8220; gap=&#8220;20&#8243; equal_height=&#8220;yes&#8220; css=&#8220;.vc_custom_1630631089914{margin-top: 40px !important;margin-bottom: 40px !important;}&#8220;][vc_column width=&#8220;1\/2&#8243; css=&#8220;.vc_custom_1631923836220{padding-right: 1em !important;padding-left: 1em !important;}&#8220;]<div id=\"ultimate-heading-82376a0da940bc72b\" class=\"uvc-heading ult-adjust-bottom-margin ultimate-heading-82376a0da940bc72b uvc-4396 \" data-hspacer=\"line_only\"  data-halign=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left\"><div class=\"uvc-main-heading ult-responsive\"  data-ultimate-target='.uvc-heading.ultimate-heading-82376a0da940bc72b h2'  data-responsive-json-new='{\"font-size\":\"\",\"line-height\":\"\"}' ><h2 style=\"font-weight:bold;\">Jak\u00fdm stylem r\u00e1dy u\u010d\u00edme?<\/h2><\/div><div class=\"uvc-heading-spacer line_only\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5em;height:1px;\"><span class=\"uvc-headings-line\" style=\"border-style:solid;border-bottom-width:1px;border-color:#af1b1d;width:autopx;\"><\/span><\/div><\/div>[vc_column_text]<\/p>\n<div id=\"layers-widget-column-9-150\" class=\"layers-widget-column-9-150 layers-masonry-column layers-widget-column-150 span-6 first column \">\n<div class=\"media image-right medium\">\n<div class=\"media-body text-left\">\n<div class=\"excerpt\">\n<ul>\n<li>Na sv\u00fdch kurzech <strong>m\u00e1me nejrad\u011bji pohodovou atmosf\u00e9ru<\/strong>, kde se ka\u017ed\u00fd c\u00edt\u00ed dob\u0159e\u2026.<\/li>\n<li>A tak \u017e\u00e1dn\u00e9 lavice, jen p\u0159\u00edjemn\u011b neform\u00e1ln\u00ed<strong>\u00a0prost\u0159ed\u00ed, kde se nemus\u00edte b\u00e1t na cokoli zeptat<\/strong>. N\u00e1\u0161 koncept se kapku inspiroval tradic\u00ed anglick\u00fdch \u010dajov\u00fdch klub\u016f. P\u0159ij\u010fte k\u00a0n\u00e1m na \u0161\u00e1lek \u010daje, u\u00a0kter\u00e9ho si budete moci pokl\u00e1bosit s\u00a0vrstevn\u00edky, a\u00a0je\u0161t\u011b se nau\u010d\u00edte nov\u00e9mu jazyku.<\/li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">\u0158\u00edk\u00e1 se, \u017ee <strong>opakov\u00e1n\u00ed\u00a0<\/strong>je matka moudrosti. My tvrd\u00edme, \u017ee je to jej\u00ed babi\u010dka. \u010casto proto opakujeme, a\u00a0to <strong>z\u00e1bavnou formou<\/strong>. M\u011bn\u00edme aktivity tak, aby bavily nejen studenty, ale i\u00a0n\u00e1s. A\u00a0pr\u00fd je to poznat!<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<li>\n<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Tempo kurzu<\/strong> je pohodov\u00e9, <strong>vhodn\u00e9 i\u00a0pro aktivn\u00ed seniory<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Budeme na v\u00e1s mluvit anglicky, kdy\u017e ale n\u011bco nechyt\u00edte, dovol\u00edme si p\u016fj\u010dit slov\u00ed\u010dko z jazyka \u010desk\u00e9ho. Mus\u00edme si p\u0159eci rozum\u011bt \ud83d\ude42<\/p>\n<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><strong>Co v\u0161echno se nau\u010d\u00edte:<\/strong><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>B\u00fdt na sebe aspo\u0148 trochu hodn\u00ed\u00a0<\/strong>a prom\u00edjet si \u201eto, \u017ee si nemohu vzpomenout\u201c nebo \u201eto, \u017ee hned plynule nemluv\u00edm\u201c. V\u0161echno m\u00e1 sv\u016fj \u010das.<\/li>\n<li>Pracovat se slovn\u00ed z\u00e1sobou, a\u00a0p\u0159edev\u0161\u00edm d\u00edky nov\u00fdm slov\u00ed\u010dk\u016fm <strong>tr\u00e9novat pam\u011b\u0165<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Mluvit a\u00a0rozum\u011bt v\u00a0angli\u010dtin\u011b<\/strong> b\u011bhem r\u016fzn\u00fdch situac\u00ed. V angli\u010dtin\u011b postupn\u011b i automaticky reagovat, ale to chce op\u011bt \u010das \ud83d\ude42<\/li>\n<li><strong>Porozum\u011bt l\u00e9pe jazyku nov\u00fdch m\u00e9di\u00ed,<\/strong> kter\u00e1 \u010dasto b\u00fdvaj\u00ed v\u00a0angli\u010dtin\u011b\u2026 nap\u0159\u00edklad internet nebo r\u016fzn\u00e9 po\u010d\u00edta\u010dov\u00e9 programy.<\/li>\n<li><strong>Ps\u00e1t a\u00a0\u010d\u00edst\u00a0materi\u00e1ly z\u00a0ka\u017edodenn\u00edho \u017eivota<\/strong>, knihy, noviny, \u00fa\u0159edn\u00ed dokumenty a t\u0159eba i milostn\u00e9 dopisy \ud83d\ude42<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p>[\/vc_column_text][\/vc_column][vc_column width=&#8220;1\/2&#8243; css=&#8220;.vc_custom_1630632287037{background-image: url(http:\/\/teaspoon.cz\/wp-content\/uploads\/2021\/09\/betka.jpg?id=31) !important;background-position: center !important;background-repeat: no-repeat !important;background-size: cover !important;border-radius: 5px !important;}&#8220;]<div class=\"ult-spacer spacer-6a0da940bc743\" data-id=\"6a0da940bc743\" data-height=\"400\" data-height-mobile=\"400\" data-height-tab=\"400\" data-height-tab-portrait=\"\" data-height-mobile-landscape=\"\" style=\"clear:both;display:block;\"><\/div>[\/vc_column][\/vc_row][vc_row section_id=&#8220;clenstvi&#8220;][vc_column]<div id=\"ultimate-heading-46166a0da940bc75f\" class=\"uvc-heading ult-adjust-bottom-margin ultimate-heading-46166a0da940bc75f uvc-7530 \" data-hspacer=\"line_only\"  data-halign=\"left\" style=\"text-align:left\"><div class=\"uvc-main-heading ult-responsive\"  data-ultimate-target='.uvc-heading.ultimate-heading-46166a0da940bc75f h2'  data-responsive-json-new=